{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/","title":"십칠추 EX-B8","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 십칠추의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"십칠추 EX-B8\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-B8\n위치\n등의 척주부위(vertebral region of back), 다섯째 허리뼈(the 5th lumbar vertebra)의 가시돌기 아래 오목한 곳.\n취혈\n腰陽關(GV3)에서 척추 가시돌기 하나만큼 아래로 내려와서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.5～1寸\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-B8","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_2","text":"등의 척주부위(vertebral region of back), 다섯째 허리뼈(the 5th lumbar vertebra)의 가시돌기 아래 오목한 곳.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_3","text":"腰陽關(GV3)에서 척추 가시돌기 하나만큼 아래로 내려와서 취혈한다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_4","text":"直刺 0.5～1寸","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-6148B1DD7C9FB435","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b8/","text_sha256":"44765d78f4600a12fa4681f0bb43bdc71da109b74263a39bd2b9956f27bac520","source_sha256":"d5bf9754a00f186043d041fa5563caab48f2e6356d70739b619718035dc688ac","commit":"242487716205b3dd13626c058663f3aa0ac3979f"}}
